        "A state agricultural insurance desk pilots area-yield cover: village rainfall records and satellite vegetation indices set the trigger, payouts arrive automatically in a drought year, and extension explains the product at farmers' meetings. Insurance and forecast services share the same data spine. Building that data-to-decision chain is the systems work of {S}.",
